{"description":"Read the Runway is a new series of conversations that brings people together to screen and discuss seminal collections.\nJoin us at our first screening to watch and discuss Anna Sui's Spring/Summer 1994 collection. A defining moment in 90s fashion, the show remains an enduring example of whimsy, femininity and play in ready-to-wear.\nCome ready to dissect your favourite looks, trace their relevance from 1994 to today, and take notes on Sui's creative approach.\nSee you there!","organizer":"Fashion Book Club"}